    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label light">Family protection</span>
      <h2 class="section-title light">Keep your whole family safe.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle light">Scammers often target the most vulnerable — elderly parents, busy professionals, teenagers. ASPS protects everyone.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="use-cases-grid">
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <div class="use-case-icon">👵</div>
