        <p>Older adults are prime targets for scammers. ASPS provides an extra layer of protection without being intrusive.</p>
        <ul class="use-case-list">
          <li>Voice cloning detection for "grandparent scams"</li>
          <li>Bank impersonation call alerts</li>
          <li>Tech support scam blocking</li>
          <li>Optional family notifications</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <div class="use-case-icon">👨‍💼</div>
