        <p>When you're juggling work and life, it's easy to miss red flags. ASPS catches what you might miss.</p>
        <ul class="use-case-list">
          <li>Business email compromise detection</li>
          <li>Invoice fraud alerts</li>
          <li>Credential phishing protection</li>
          <li>Works silently in the background</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <div class="use-case-icon">👩‍🎓</div>
        <h3>Young adults & students</h3>
        <p>First-time financial independence makes young adults vulnerable to sophisticated scams.</p>
        <ul class="use-case-list">
          <li>Job scam detection</li>
          <li>Rental fraud alerts</li>
          <li>Romance scam warnings</li>
          <li>Social media scam protection</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <div class="use-case-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</div>
        <h3>Tableau de bord familial</h3>
